The response object
Answer with one JSON object and nothing else:
- "choice": the handle of one offered attempt, such as "A3".
- "speech": null, or the words you say with it: "text" (exactly what you say), "to" (a list of person handles such as ["P2"], or ["everyone"]) and "volume" (whisper, low, normal, raised or shout).
- "manner": a few words on how you do it, or "" for none. It changes nothing about what happens.
- "goal": what you want next, in one short sentence.
- "private_reason": why, briefly, in your own words. It is private and not spoken.
